79	    // If there aren't any Swift Package plugins and the project hasn't been
80	    // migrated yet, don't generate a Swift package or migrate the app since
81	    // it's not needed. If the project has already been migrated, regenerate
82	    // the Package.swift even if there are no dependencies in case there
